	design/tokens.toml.
	* crates/crabbucket-cli: New crate; the `crab' executable.
	* examples/site: New site; crabbucket's own, built with crabbucket.
	* design/tokens.toml: New file; the token source of truth.
	* turborust.toml: New file; the dev loop.
	* .github/workflows/ci.yml, .github/workflows/pages.yml: New files.
	* Cargo.toml, Makefile, .gitignore, rustfmt.toml: New files.
	* README, NEWS, AUTHORS, THANKS, HACKING, COPYING: New files.
